{
    "title": "Ark - Christian Dating App",
    "description": "ARK was built to give Christian singles a fun, modern dating app that doesn\u2019t require Christians to compromise their true selves or their faith. The world is full of cheap hook-up apps, old boring dating websites from your grandparents' days, and apps made people that don\u2019t know Jesus. Ark is different and a place to date differently. Ark lights a new path for single Christians of all faiths to start dating intentionally.\r\n\r\nWe understand how hard it can be for single Christians to create lasting connections while upholding their values and keeping the faith, which is why we\u2019ve created Ark, a Christian dating app for believers made by believers. Ark allows single Christians to join, meet, and date inside an incredible community of like minded individuals totally for free. We\u2019re for the compassionate Christians, lovers of life, salt of the Earth, and Jesus freaks searching for love!\r\n\r\nArk was built to keep you safe while getting you where you want to be (sounds like another Ark we\u2019ve heard of in the Bible somewhere). In everything we do we are intentional, so in everything you do you can be intentional! We are THE place where Christ centered connections are created; there are plenty of hookup apps out there that make dating a confusing experience, if that\u2019s all you\u2019re looking for, you might want to swim back to shore, Ark is for intentional dating!\r\n\r\nHOW ARK HELPS YOU DATE DIFFERENTLY\r\n\r\n- Ark REQUIRES quality profiles. You have to be intentional about your profile. Shirtless photos, suggestive content, creepy selfies won\u2019t pass our review process. We don\u2019t let everyone in the Ark. If you don\u2019t have holy intentions, or are a creep\u2026 go download a different app. \r\n\r\n- Grab your bible, Ark REQUIRES profile verification. Our Christian team members use a combination of human review and powerful AI to vet your profile and fill the Ark only with real christian people.\r\n\r\n- Swiping is DIFFERENT on Ark too. Swipe up to show you like someone. Tap the heart to leave a free comment on their pictures or conversation prompts. Swipe down to skip and see someone else. Remember, these are real Christian singles. Follow the example of Jesus Christ and be kind to one another\u2026 or we\u2019ll BAN you.  \r\n\r\n- See who likes you FREE in your Ark feed. If someone likes your profile, or leaves you a comment, you can see what they sent you right in their profile to help you decide if you want to match.\r\n\r\n- When two people like each other, it becomes a match. Chat with your new Christian friends, and if you\u2019ve got chemistry, go meet them on a date somewhere public and safe. \r\n\r\n- Have FUN! Meet and mingle with amazing Christian people from all over the USA. You are not alone. Despite what the media wants us to believe, there are still so many wonderful Christian people in this country. Christianity will not die. Christianity will not go away. Christian\u2019s will thrive and help save this world.\r\n\r\n- Spread the good word! We want you to find love, and do everything we can to help you, so your voyage on Ark won\u2019t last forever. When you find your soulmate, let all your Christian friends know that you met your special somebody on an Ark.\r\n\r\n\r\nArk - Christian Dating App is free to use, allowing you to enjoy free matching, messaging and more! We want you to find love just as much as you do, we\u2019re here to help you invest in the kind of relationship you want and deserve!\r\n\r\nOur Christian community welcomes Christian singles of all faiths and denominations! If you are single and Catholic, Anglican, Evangelical, Baptist, Reformed, Orthodox, Pentecostal, Lutheran, Methodist, Nondenominational or simply accept Jesus Christ then Ark is the christian dating app made for you. \r\n\r\nArk Christian Dating App is only available to those who are single and of age 18 and upward.\r\n\r\nPrivacy: https://support.arkdating.app/article/72-privacy-policy\r\nTerms: https://support.arkdating.app/article/71-terms-of-service\r\nCommunity Standards: https://arkdating.app/standards",
    "descriptionHTML": "ARK was built to give Christian singles a fun, modern dating app that doesn\u2019t require Christians to compromise their true selves or their faith. The world is full of cheap hook-up apps, old boring dating websites from your grandparents&#39; days, and apps made people that don\u2019t know Jesus. Ark is different and a place to date differently. Ark lights a new path for single Christians of all faiths to start dating intentionally.<br><br>We understand how hard it can be for single Christians to create lasting connections while upholding their values and keeping the faith, which is why we\u2019ve created Ark, a Christian dating app for believers made by believers. Ark allows single Christians to join, meet, and date inside an incredible community of like minded individuals totally for free. We\u2019re for the compassionate Christians, lovers of life, salt of the Earth, and Jesus freaks searching for love!<br><br>Ark was built to keep you safe while getting you where you want to be (sounds like another Ark we\u2019ve heard of in the Bible somewhere). In everything we do we are intentional, so in everything you do you can be intentional! We are THE place where Christ centered connections are created; there are plenty of hookup apps out there that make dating a confusing experience, if that\u2019s all you\u2019re looking for, you might want to swim back to shore, Ark is for intentional dating!<br><br>HOW ARK HELPS YOU DATE DIFFERENTLY<br><br>- Ark REQUIRES quality profiles. You have to be intentional about your profile. Shirtless photos, suggestive content, creepy selfies won\u2019t pass our review process. We don\u2019t let everyone in the Ark. If you don\u2019t have holy intentions, or are a creep\u2026 go download a different app. <br><br>- Grab your bible, Ark REQUIRES profile verification. Our Christian team members use a combination of human review and powerful AI to vet your profile and fill the Ark only with real christian people.<br